dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]the same 400 px column as screenshots, and `Z` opens a calm, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]keyboard-first player that shares the image viewer's chrome, origin[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]line, and `y`/`r` gestures. Every attachment bob copies is one [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]vault sync can carry, and Bob Mac Capture previews a video as a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]video.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]video_attachments_z_player.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/video_attachments_z_player.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-mj[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-mj/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-cli: the video attachment kind[/bold #D7AFFF]                            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-video[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-video: add AttachmentKind::Video (mp4 mov webm mkv) copied to vid/ [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and embedded at 400 px on every %c route and bob attachments import; add[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]size_bytes to attachment JSON and sizes to human output; fix the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]would-save padding; write the shared media catalog in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs/attachments.md; mark the commit with !.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-plugins: the VideoZoomModal player[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]plugin-video-viewer[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugin-video-viewer: add behavior-preserving media hooks to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ImageZoomModal and build VideoZoomModal on them (start policy, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Space/click play, arrow seeks, readout, zoom/pan, o/y/r, in-place [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]failure card, full decoder teardown) with pure helpers and Node-harness [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tests; not yet wired to Z.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-cli: streamed copies and sync guards for every attachment[/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-guards[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli-video[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-guards: stream attachment hashing and copying (no whole-file [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]buffers, abort when the source changes after planning), refuse [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]attachments of 95 MiB or more and destinations the vault .gitignore [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ignores, warn at 50 MiB, document the new codes, and record the decision[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]strand; mark the commit with !.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-plugins: Z dispatches videos, imports video paths, sizes [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]inline clips[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]plugin-z-dispatch[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli-video, plugin-video-viewer[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugin-z-dispatch: teach the Z resolver and path-bullet import about the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]video catalog, open VideoZoomModal for videos, degrade against an old [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob, ship the inline 400 px embed CSS, update the image-zoom docs, add [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the real-Obsidian video e2e harness, and deploy with bob plugins sync.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-mac-capture: videos in the clip card[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-video-card[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli-video[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-video-card: count videos in the clip header, show size_bytes, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]render a cancellable, cached AVFoundation poster with a play glyph and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]duration badge for video rows, staying a thin client of bob's kind; [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]green exact-SHA macOS CI.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-plugins: scrubber, frame step, speed, mute, fullscreen[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]plugin-video-transport[dim] · [dim][/dim]after plugin-z-dispatch[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugin-video-transport: add the hairline scrubber with hover time bubble[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and drag seek, frame stepping, playback speed, g/G, mute, fullscreen, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and the play/pause flash to VideoZoomModal; extend the real-Obsidian e2e[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and docs; deploy.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-mj","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-mj.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-beae9fbf274184dc22cfcba38d06d966","started_at":"2026-11-16T22:33:25.866411+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"e237d3211fdeb5e5d4a0fc41e6c8660e01580fdfde89441496aa7e86cf6a66ba","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-mj.2/chat.md","size_bytes":6549},"commits":{"digest":"e6b0bce5ce0f13fddab5b5a01d068439a0a4e425fb5635c7eb1a6645d0daddcf","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-mj.2/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-mj.